        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>poll tax</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of poll tax" onclick="speakGloss(event,'poll tax')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(POHL TAX)</span>: A fee people had to pay before they were allowed to vote.</div>
        <div style="font-size: 16px; color: #1a2340; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong>primary election</strong><button type="button" class="gloss-audio" aria-label="Play pronunciation of primary election" onclick="speakGloss(event,'primary election')">&#128266;</button> <span style="color: #6b7a99;">(PRY-mair-ee ee-LEK-shun)</span>: An election held before the main election, where a party chooses its candidates.</div>
